&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;ssh-keygen&lt;/code&gt; 检查签名，并拒绝任何其他命名空间中的签名：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ ssh-keygen -Y verify -f allowed -I bridge -n krl@go-authn.github.io -s bridge.krl.sig &amp;lt; bridge.krl
Good &amp;#34;krl@go-authn.github.io&amp;#34; signature for bridge with ED25519 key SHA256:Fpa/Ku2Wv1EDCR&amp;#43;KSsqZ2eECTM1zftiBWj01Lr&amp;#43;NO2Q&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="复制代码"
aria-label="复制代码"
data-copied-label="已复制！"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其中 &lt;code&gt;allowed&lt;/code&gt; 是这一行：&lt;code&gt;bridge namespaces=&amp;quot;krl@go-authn.github.io&amp;quot; &amp;lt;the CA key from /ssh/config&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;十五秒之后签发的 CRL：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ openssl crl -inform DER -in var/bridge.crl -noout -text
Certificate Revocation List (CRL):
Version 2 (0x1)
Signature Algorithm: ecdsa-with-SHA256
Issuer: CN=go-authn bridge NFS client CA
